Package: spark
Version: @VERSION@
Architecture: @ARCH@
Maintainer: Lantern <team@getlantern.org>
Section: net
Priority: optional
Depends: libc6
Description: From-scratch multi-protocol VPN/proxy tunnel
 spark routes traffic through a local TUN device, terminates connections in a
 userspace netstack, and forwards them through pluggable tunnel transports.
 This package installs the privileged spark-service daemon (with a systemd unit)
 and the unprivileged spark control client.
